    -> PX Sender (slice: 1; workers: 1)
        -> Filter: ((t3.a < 10) and (t3.b > 2))  (cost=2.06 rows=7)
            -> Parallel index range scan on t3 using PRIMARY  (cost=2.06 rows=9)

