EXPLAIN
-> PX Receiver (merge sort; slice: 0; workers: 1)
    -> PX Sender (slice: 1; workers: 1)
        -> Sort: t3.b, t3.c DESC  (cost=1.25 rows=10)
            -> Filter: ((t3.c > 1) and (t3.d > 2))  (cost=1.25 rows=10)
